{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06359","headline":"送刘四 · 李颀","name":"送刘四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爱君少岐嶷，高视白云乡。\n九岁能属文，谒帝游明光。\n奉诏赤墀下，拜爲童子郎。\n尔来屡迁易，三度尉洛阳。\n洛阳十二门，官寺郁相望。\n青槐罗四面，渌水贯中央。\n听讼破秋毫，应物利干将。\n辞满如脱屣，立言无否臧。\n岁暮风雪暗，秦中川路长。\n行人饮腊酒，立马带晨霜。\n生事岂须问，故园寒草荒。\n从今署右职，莫笑在农桑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06359.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06359","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}